### Search requires at least 9 characters

#### When I type <search> in the VIN search the button is <status>

- **Given** I am a user on the home page
- **When** I search by VIN
- **When** I type "<search>" in the search field
- **Then** the "Search" button is <status>

**Examples**

| search | status |
| --- | --- |
|  | disabled |
| 0 | disabled |
| 01 | disabled |
| 01234567 | disabled |
| 012345678 | enabled |
| 0123456789 | enabled |

